# Who opens the conversation (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Who opens a conversation"): a post's speaker puts
# the question to someone in their kit below Known at 35 m, whether or not they press Talk, so walking
# up in a borrowed jacket doesn't skip it. The claim itself is still yours to make: the topics below
# the greeting are the claim, the word, and the truth. Walking away is no claim.

conv post.bastion.opens
for post:bastion
when kit:in_kit & !caught & !passing
greet
opens approach 35
prio quest
voice bastion

node start
  say? kit:signed_other :: "Stop there. That's {kit_owner}'s jacket. Signed for. So where's {kit_owner}?"
  say? kit:dead_mans :: "Stop there. That's {dead_name}'s kit. His name's on the nail behind the radio."
  say? kit:off_turned :: "Stop there. That's off one of ours. Where is he?"
  say "You. Not on the board. Stop there."

conv post.redhand.opens
for post:redhand
when kit:in_kit & !caught & !passing
greet
opens approach 35
prio quest
voice redhand

node start
  say? kit:signed_other :: "Oi. That armband's got {kit_owner}'s name in the book. You're not {kit_owner}."
  say? kit:dead_mans :: "Oi. That's {dead_name}'s. We put {dead_name} in the book last week. Paid."
  say? kit:off_turned :: "Oi. You took that off one of them. Off one of ours, before that."
  say "Oi! New face, our colours. Come here and tell me a story."

# Kit that remembers whose it was, said without any claim, at a faction's holdings (Bastion's are in
# cover.rzd)
conv named.redhand.kit_issued
for named:redhand
when kit:issued & !tier:redhand>=known
greet
voice redhand
daily

node start
  say "Still wearing the armband the boss gave you? Bold. The book says you owe for it now."

conv named.halcyon.kit_issued
for named:halcyon
when kit:issued & !tier:halcyon>=known
greet
voice halcyon
daily

node start
  say "Your coat is on our register. Your name is on another one now. Please return the coat."

# Cover details said as choices (docs/REPUTATION.md, "Borrowed kit"): your own crew name, a notebook
# number (the cover lines with a name are in cover.rzd). Each is the look's +1 when it's true; the look
# decides, its score shown before you pick.
conv post.redhand.crewname
for post:redhand
when kit:in_kit & !caught & crew
topic "Give them your crew name."
prio quest
voice redhand

node start
  say "What do they call you, then? Everybody's called something."
  > @name "They call me {crew}." -> passed | caught   check look redhand 2
  > @leave "Never mind." -> hub

node passed
  say "{crew}! Course they do. Go on, and stop looking at the lorry."
  do call:post_wave
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node caught
  say "Nobody calls you anything. That's the problem. Armband off."
  > @back2 "Fair enough." -> hub

conv named.halcyon.claim
for named:halcyon
when kit:in_kit & !caught
topic "Say you're with the lab."
prio quest
voice halcyon

node start
  say "Badge, or notebook number. One or the other. Policy."
  > @notebook "{cover}. I'm on the field team." -> passed | caught   check look halcyon 2   if cover:notebook
  > @claim "Field team. Let me through." -> passed | caught   check look halcyon 2
  > @truth "Not with the lab. The coat was there." -> honest
  > @leave "Never mind." -> hub

node passed
  say "Fine. Ten minutes. Don't touch anything labelled. Everything is labelled."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node caught
  say "No. The coat goes back on the hook. Security will want a word."
  > @back2 "Understood." -> hub

node honest
  say "Thank you for saying so. Please take it off before somebody writes you down."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub
